EESchema Schematic File Version 4
EELAYER 30 0
EELAYER END
$Descr User 40600 30800
encoding utf-8
Sheet 1 1
Title "Traction Inverter — Control Card (S32K396 + FS26, ASIL D)"
Date "2026-09-09"
Rev "A.3"
Comp "Traction Inverter 220 kW pk - Control card (LV), sheet 3 of 3"
Comment1 "Inverter = Power board (HV) + bolt-on Discharge board (HV) + Control card (LV); safe state holds with any link lost"
Comment2 "Content: S32K396 lockstep MCU + FS2633D ASIL-D SBC + resolver AFE + hall AFE + CAN-FD + safety chain"
Comment3 "26 functional sections - 219 components - cross-section links are net labels; wires are pin stubs only"
Comment4 "Every component carries MPN + LCSC fields (CLASS = buy to class spec, ALT footprint-compatible second source in BOM)"
$EndDescr
